<section class="bg-[#FAFAF8] py-24 text-[#1A1A1A] md:py-36">
    <div class="public-container">
        <div class="w-full">
            <header class="mb-14 text-center opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-[opacity,translate] duration-1000 ease-out" data-reveal>
                <p class="public-eyebrow my-0">@(isDutch ? "Onze werkwijze" : "The iD! approach")</p>
                <h2 class="mx-auto mt-5 mb-5 w-full text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem)] font-medium leading-tight text-[#071F3D] [font-family:var(--serif-heading)]">@(isDutch ? "Wat je van ons kunt verwachten" : "What you can expect from us")</h2>
                <p class="mx-auto m-0 max-w-[42rem] text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.7] text-[#535353]">@(isDutch ? "En geen coach die boven je staat. Bij iD! werk je op gelijkwaardig niveau, niet met iemand die het beter weet." : "And no coach standing above you. At iD! you work on equal footing, not with someone who claims to know better.")</p>
            </header>

            <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl space-y-16 opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-[opacity,translate] duration-1000 ease-out md:mt-24 md:space-y-24" data-reveal>
                <nav class="hidden" data-approach-navigation aria-label="@(isDutch ? "Stappen in onze werkwijze" : "Steps in our approach")">
                    <button class="group flex min-w-max items-center gap-3 border-0 bg-transparent px-3 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-[#535353] transition-colors hover:text-[#071F3D] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#B23A48] focus-visible:outline-offset-3 lg:min-w-0 lg:px-4" type="button" data-approach-nav data-approach-index="0"><span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-[#B23A48]">01</span><span>@(isDutch ? "We gaan meteen naar de kern" : "We go straight to the core")</span></button>
                    <button class="group flex min-w-max items-center gap-3 border-0 bg-transparent px-3 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-[#535353] transition-colors hover:text-[#071F3D] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#B23A48] focus-visible:outline-offset-3 lg:min-w-0 lg:px-4" type="button" data-approach-nav data-approach-index="1"><span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-[#B23A48]">02</span><span>@(isDutch ? "We maken het passend, niet standaard" : "We make it fit you")</span></button>
                    <button class="group flex min-w-max items-center gap-3 border-0 bg-transparent px-3 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-[#535353] transition-colors hover:text-[#071F3D] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#B23A48] focus-visible:outline-offset-3 lg:min-w-0 lg:px-4" type="button" data-approach-nav data-approach-index="2"><span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-[#B23A48]">03</span><span>@(isDutch ? "Je gaat direct aan de slag" : "You get started right away")</span></button>
                    <button class="group flex min-w-max items-center gap-3 border-0 bg-transparent px-3 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-[#535353] transition-colors hover:text-[#071F3D] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#B23A48] focus-visible:outline-offset-3 lg:min-w-0 lg:px-4" type="button" data-approach-nav data-approach-index="3"><span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-[#B23A48]">04</span><span>@(isDutch ? "We kijken mee en sturen bij" : "We stay involved and adjust")</span></button>
                </nav>
                <div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden bg-[#D8D3CC]"></div>
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="hidden" data-approach-stage aria-live="polite">
                        <p class="m-0 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#B23A48]" data-approach-stage-number></p>
                        <h3 class="mt-4 mb-0 text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem)] font-medium leading-[1.1] text-[#071F3D] [font-family:var(--serif-heading)]" data-approach-stage-title></h3>
                        <p class="mt-6 mb-0 max-w-[38rem] text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.75] text-[#535353]" data-approach-stage-description></p>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="m-0 grid list-none gap-16 p-0 md:gap-24" data-approach-features>
                <li class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:gap-16" data-approach-feature data-approach-index="0">
                    <div class="flex h-min shrink-0 items-center gap-3 md:w-64"><span class="grid size-8 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#B23A48]/[0.07] text-xs text-[#B23A48]"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="text-[0.7rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] leading-snug text-[#071F3D] [font-family:var(--serif-label)]">@(isDutch ? "We gaan meteen naar de kern" : "We go straight to the core")</span></div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col">
                        <h3 class="m-0 text-[1.05rem] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-[#071F3D]">@(isDutch ? "We gaan meteen naar de kern" : "We go straight to the core")</h3>
                        <p class="mt-[0.55rem] mb-0 max-w-[42rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#535353]">@(isDutch ? "Geen lange intake-formulieren of vrijblijvend rondpraten. In het eerste gesprek zoeken we samen uit wat er écht speelt en wat je nodig hebt; niet wat het boekje voorschrijft." : "No lengthy intake forms or non-committal small talk. In the very first conversation, we work together to figure out what's really going on and what you actually need; not what the textbook prescribes.")</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:gap-16" data-approach-feature data-approach-index="1">
                    <div class="flex h-min shrink-0 items-center gap-3 md:w-64"><span class="grid size-8 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#B23A48]/[0.07] text-xs text-[#B23A48]"><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="text-[0.7rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] leading-snug text-[#071F3D] [font-family:var(--serif-label)]">@(isDutch ? "We maken het passend, niet standaard" : "We make it fit you")</span></div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col">
                        <h3 class="m-0 text-[1.05rem] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-[#071F3D]">@(isDutch ? "We maken het passend, niet standaard" : "We make it fit you, not the other way around")</h3>
                        <p class="mt-[0.55rem] mb-0 max-w-[42rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#535353]">@(isDutch ? "Je werkt met onze beproefde programma's, en waar nodig ontwikkelen we iets speciaal voor jou of je team. Elk doel, of het nu gaat om een taalniveau, een carrièrevraag, een team dat beter wil communiceren, of een bedrijf dat wil groeien, vraagt immers om een andere aanpak." : "You'll work with our tried-and-tested programs, and where needed, we develop something specifically for you or your team. Every goal, whether it's a language level, a career question, a team that wants to communicate better, or a company that wants to grow, calls for its own approach.")</p>
                    </div>
